Ceas
=== start/en
¶A localized clock in one line of code. @Now ticks a new @Moment every second, and \Acum(
) → ''\ converts each one to text in your locale, calendar, and time zone, so the clock changes language when your locale does. Try giving @Now a frequency, time zone, and calendar, like \Acum(
	1s
	'Asia/Tokyo'
	'japanese'
)\.¶
Fraza(Acum() → '' faţă: 'Doto')
